[h2]Dear players:[/h2]

Thank you for your support and love.
Since the game was released, we've received a lot of comments from players and found a lot of issues that we've ignored before.

We've combined the most critical issues in our opinion with an urgent [b]V1.1.2[/b] release update!


[h2]Here's what's in this update:[/h2]

[h3]Change[/h3]
[olist]
[*] According to the player feedback game difficult problem, adjust the overall difficulty of the game;
[*] Reduce the length of each game, taking into account the player experience;
[*] Part of the code of the score calculation system and story manager was refactored to improve performance.
[*] In the settings to add the brightness adjustment function, to ensure that the night play when yours eyes are not blind;
[*] Add visual effects to the "Production Group" button in the settings when it cannot be clicked (players need to clear any difficult game before they can watch the Production Group page);
[/olist]
[h3]Repair[/h3]
[olist]
[*] Fixed a BUG that prevented the "opportunity card" from being pulled out smoothly in normal and difficult modes;
[*] Fixes an issue where cards recur in the same game;
[*] Fixes an archive error caused by play adjustment;
[*] Fixed some text word problems;
[*] *Try to fix a problem that caused the game to be unsys responseed for a long time due to device performance;
[/olist]
[h3]Optimization[/h3]
[olist]
[*] Upgrade the game engine version to Unity 2019.4 LTS;
[*] Crop part of the resource volume, reduce the size of the package;
[/olist]
--------------------

[strike]Due to the important module refactoring and engine version changes involved, this update will be released to the [beta] channel to ensure that players do not experience adverse experiences.
Players who want to experience the new version as soon as possible can switch to the [beta] channel in the Game Properties interface of the Team client.
We will roll out updates to all players after determining that this release is fully stable.[/strike]
[b]This update has been verified and pushed to all players![/b]


Sura@TOWA Software
October 4, 2020
